00:51:59.700 --> 00:52:02.070
And what do you want your life to look like

1121
00:52:02.070 --> 00:52:03.060
on a daily basis?

1122
00:52:03.060 --> 00:52:04.560
Like, how manageable

1123
00:52:04.560 --> 00:52:07.800
or how much agency do you wanna have over your time?

1124
