1131
00:52:23.730 --> 00:52:25.920
about and making sure that you have the energy

1132
00:52:25.920 --> 00:52:28.470
for the things that are most important to you.

1133
00:52:28.470 --> 00:52:32.173
Yeah, and I think, sometimes it is like analysis

1134
