So it goes back to that toolkit.

1166
00:54:04.890 --> 00:54:06.870
I'm developing my own toolkit.

1167
00:54:06.870 --> 00:54:09.330
I'm educating myself around basic terminology

1168
00:54:09.330 --> 00:54:10.260
like, what is crypto?

1169
00:54:10.260 --> 00:54:11.670
What is a non fungible token?

1170
00:54:11.670 --> 00:54:12.503
You know?

1171
00:54:12.503 --> 00:54:15.720
And along that process, I'm really trying

1172
00:54:15.720 --> 00:54:18.870
to consider who are the right partners in this space,

1173
00:54:18.870 --> 00:54:23.870
