Well, Drew is very pretty well versed.

1179
00:54:37.200 --> 00:54:41.820
He has been involved in crypto and Bitcoin for a few years,

1180
00:54:41.820 --> 00:54:44.100
and so it's actually really neat because

1181
00:54:44.100 --> 00:54:46.320
for the first time, we're working together

1182
00:54:46.320 --> 00:54:49.770
in ways that it now feel faded,

1183
00:54:49.770 --> 00:54:54.480
but like, didn't feel timely before, and now it's the time.

1184
00:54:54.480 --> 00:54:57.030
Yeah, let's talk about life pivots,

1185
00:54:57.030 --> 00:54:59.370
we're both recovering corporate lawyers.

1186
00:54:59.370 --> 00:55:01.290
I think you have a greater fondness

1187
00:55:01.290 --> 00:55:04.020
