00:55:15.930 --> 00:55:17.880
or, "I'm looking for a change."

1194
00:55:17.880 --> 00:55:19.443
Like, how did you do it?

1195
00:55:20.310 --> 00:55:25.310
I really, I did a three part.

1196
00:55:26.160 --> 00:55:29.101
I only now understand this as a three-part audit,

1197
00:55:29.101 --> 00:55:31.950
but I did a three-part audit when I was a lawyer.

1198
00:55:31.950 --> 00:55:36.240
So I realized that I had fallen in love

1199
00:55:36.240 --> 00:55:37.470
with running and movement,

1200
00:55:37.470 --> 00:55:39.880
and it was a two-year journey

1201
00:55:40.800 --> 00:55:45.120
from that ideation phase to the departure phase.

1202
00:55:45.120 --> 00:55:48.150
And in those two years, I did a three-part audit.

1203
00:55:48.150 --> 00:55:50.610
I would say one was a physical audit of like,

1204
00:55:50.610 --> 00:55:52.350
how am I feel feeling in my physical body?

1205
00:55:52.350 --> 00:55:53.790
Like, energy is currency, like,

1206
00:55:53.790 --> 00:55:56.400
how can I capitalize on the energy that I'm feeling,

1207
00:55:56.400 --> 00:56:00.090
and what are the avenues and the tools

1208
00:56:00.090 --> 00:56:04.440
that I am feeling more filled with energy?

1209
00:56:04.440 --> 00:56:08.190
Then the second was a more existential question of like,

1210
00:56:08.190 --> 00:56:09.060
and I had a lot of this,

1211
00:56:09.060 --> 00:56:11.797
especially in my 20s after the hostage situation of like,

1212
00:56:11.797 --> 00:56:12.630
"What am I doing?

1213
00:56:12.630 --> 00:56:13.463
Why am I here?

1214
00:56:13.463 --> 00:56:14.703
Why did I survive?

1215
00:56:15.810 --> 00:56:16.947
Who am I?"

1216
00:56:18.600 --> 00:56:20.520
And then the third was a very bras tax,

1217
00:56:20.520 --> 00:56:23.370
like financial audit of how the hell

1218
00:56:23.370 --> 00:56:25.149
am I gonna pay my rent in New York City?

1219
00:56:25.149 --> 00:56:28.030
How can I not move in with my parents

1220
00:56:29.160 --> 00:56:32.370
and still be financially stable?

1221
00:56:32.370 --> 00:56:34.890
And what skillset am I gonna leverage

1222
00:56:34.890 --> 00:56:37.830
in order to make sure that I'm still employable

1223
00:56:37.830 --> 00:56:39.930
when I'm not doing what my degree says

1224
00:56:39.930 --> 00:56:40.763
I should be doing?

1225
00:56:40.763 --> 00:56:43.519
On the second prong of that audit, the whole,

1226
00:56:43.519 --> 00:56:47.430
like, how do you begin to unpack and answer that?

1227
00:56:47.430 --> 00:56:50.010
That's where journaling really came into the picture.

1228
00:56:50.010 --> 00:56:55.010
And journaling vision boards and honestly, social media,

1229
00:56:56.670 --> 00:56:59.730
like, the storytelling and the scrapbook nature

1230
00:56:59.730 --> 00:57:01.533
that I approached social media with,

1231
00:57:03.990 --> 00:57:06.300
even during like Tumblr days, and gosh,

1232
00:57:06.300 --> 00:57:08.850
I don't even know what other platforms.

1233
00:57:08.850 --> 00:57:10.260
MySpace.

1234
00:57:10.260 --> 00:57:12.910
I did have a MySpace, I had a friend star (laughs).

