1242
00:57:32.430 --> 00:57:33.263
Yeah, eight or nine.

1243
00:57:33.263 --> 00:57:36.330
You had already been at it for quite a number of years.

1244
00:57:36.330 --> 00:57:37.890
This is something I'm always reminding people

1245
00:57:37.890 --> 00:57:39.060
