1246
00:57:39.060 --> 00:57:41.220
Like, these things don't happen.

1247
00:57:41.220 --> 00:57:46.220
I mean, overnight is an absurd notion, it's decades for me

1248
00:57:46.500 --> 00:57:48.750
of constantly growing and trying to figure this out,

1249
00:57:48.750 --> 00:57:52.830
and doing it imperfectly, and incorrectly, and inelegantly.

1250
00:57:52.830 --> 00:57:54.660
And your initial move out

1251
00:57:54.660 --> 00:57:56.790
of the law was really as a journalist.

1252
00:57:56.790 --> 00:57:59.570
Yes, I thought I was gonna...

1253
00:58:01.380 --> 00:58:05.700
'Cause I think it's human nature to go

1254
00:58:05.700 --> 00:58:08.010
to the frameworks that are already existing.

1255
00:58:08.010 --> 00:58:09.870
And I thought, "Okay, if I know how to write

1256
00:58:09.870 --> 00:58:12.390
and I love sports, then obviously I'm just gonna go write

1257
00:58:12.390 --> 00:58:13.223
for a sports magazine."

1258
00:58:13.223 --> 00:58:15.270
Yeah, that's a strength as a lawyer,

1259
00:58:15.270 --> 00:58:17.490
you know how to write, you have this love for running.

1260
00:58:17.490 --> 00:58:19.980
It's not immediately apparent how that's gonna translate

1261
00:58:19.980 --> 00:58:22.237
