1262
00:58:22.237 --> 00:58:24.960
(laughs) Right.

1263
00:58:24.960 --> 00:58:26.520
You're not gonna win the New York Marathon,

1264
00:58:26.520 --> 00:58:27.353
and even if you did,

1265
00:58:27.353 --> 00:58:28.860
that would probably barely pay your rent.

1266
00:58:28.860 --> 00:58:31.020
Exactly, there's no longevity in that.

1267
00:58:31.020 --> 00:58:34.263
Like, how does this whole thing scale?

1268
00:58:35.130 --> 00:58:37.087
That was the question of asking myself,

1269
00:58:37.087 --> 00:58:39.480
"How does this scale?"

1270
00:58:39.480 --> 00:58:44.480
I put on my vision board disruptive technology,

1271
00:58:46.290 --> 00:58:50.370
and then I read about Peloton,

1272
00:58:50.370 --> 00:58:52.890
